 * Transcript parsing utilities for Claude Code JSONL files.
 *
 * These helpers are pure functions over the parsed transcript: reading the
 * JSONL file, normalizing timestamps to nanoseconds, extracting rendered
 * text from message content, and locating the "real" user turns and final
